---
component: keepsake
effects: true
params:
  who: speaker
  item: { type: { entity: keepsake } }
  need: number
beat:
  on: talk
  target: "npc.@who"
  title: "Something to keep"
  priority: 45
  once: user
  when: "user.bond[@who] >= @need"
---

## Keepsake

::body
::gift{from=@who item=@item}
@narrator{code="0010"}: {{@who}} presses {{@item}} into her hands and will not take it back.
